# Claude accounts for `clo -a NAME`. Copy to
#     ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/agents-shared/claude-accounts
# and keep it there, untracked. init-global.sh creates and extends it for you through
# scripts/register-claude-account, so copying is only needed to rename an account.
#
# One line per account: a name, then its Claude config folder (~ allowed). The first
# line is the default account, and its folder is ~/.claude, whatever profile that
# account has. Blank lines and # comments are skipped.
#
# Naming: every other account gets ~/.claude-<name>, so 1 to 20 accounts sort together
# and each folder says whose it is. Each folder declares its own profile in its own
# paths.local.sh (AGENT_PROFILE=personal or AGENT_PROFILE=work), which says nothing
# about the order here, and is installed separately:
#     CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=~/.claude-<name> bash "$AGENTS_SHARED/scripts/init-global.sh"
#
# name        config folder
main          ~/.claude
second        ~/.claude-second
